# NoxExplorer Activity Log

This file is automatically updated by the GitHub Actions keep-alive workflow.

Format: `TIMESTAMP ACTION DETAILS`

Example:
```
2026-11-20T12:00:00Z pinged https://your-app.up.railway.app
2026-11-20T12:03:00Z pinged https://your-app.up.railway.app
2026-11-20T12:06:00Z pinged https://your-app.up.railway.app
```

The log keeps only the last 100 entries.
